# Room 3 — Operator review (locked 2026-09-11)

**Good** = this trade was good. Fortify the gene’s core detectors after **3**. Extras sit in **Purgatoria** until the same extra shows **three** times on that gene. Do not overfit one ticker-day. Layout = family. Letter = gene.

**Bad** = this *shot* was off, not “the letter is dead.” **Handle** (when X, do Y) can apply **now** — prefer **limit** / wait-pullback. That can change order style (slippage). It does **not** change size. **Hunt** (detectors) waits for **two** Bads on **two names** before hunt_caution (patient entry). Bye-bye is never a Bad tap.

Vote only cards that already show **TF + strategy**. Dash cards (no TF / strategy) are **dropped from Operator review** — they cannot be voted and must not learn. Log and P/L stay.

**Buttons now:** Hunt / Handle / Purgatoria overlays. Match-floor fade is dead. Vault / Supabase stay read-only. Revert = Strategy health → DNA versions.

**2026-09-10:** Operator review pile rejected — log and P/L stay, no Good/Bad, no DNA.

Handle limit-on-first-Bad is a live order default — said out loud on the review caption.

